  <li>PostgreSQL 18, <a href="https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/tutorial-agg.html">Aggregate Functions tutorial</a>: source and group filtering; <a href="https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/sql-select.html#SQL-GROUPBY">SELECT</a> for primary-key dependency allowances.</li>
  <li>SQLite, <a href="https://www.sqlite.org/lang_select.html#bare_columns_in_an_aggregate_query">Bare columns in an aggregate query</a>: why acceptance of an ungrouped expression is not portable.</li>
